    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="afdcc7ec-be46-5ad6-92b4-6a8820cf411f" activityNameId="42a12c85-072b-5105-a2e0-4291e5d1b5e0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Facilities precious metal refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Facilities precious metal refinery
The precious metal plant is equipped as follows: 1 Electrolyte cell, 1 Eluation cell, 5 Electrowinning cell, 1 Calcination furnace, 1 Smelting furnace, 1 Electrorefining cell. A building hall houses the equipment covering 5'000m2. The service life time assumed is 25 years, the yearly capacity of anode slime treatment is 243 t.;
UUID: 4764de46-218c-35ad-8191-f21c290946f3
Construction of facilities and housing, and their disposal. No transports and construction work considered.
Location: Data describes a Swedish plant that is singular in the region and ranges worldwide among the big producer. It may be taken as approximation for the global situation
Technology: Due to high temperature chromium steel and refractory materials are used. Kaldo converter and converter aisle considered.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: see Geography and Technology
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4764de46-218c-35ad-8191-f21c290946f3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="742ea452-def3-5572-8ad0-bf9058ef212d" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
